{title: 667 - Lord, Bless Thy Word to Every Heart}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #667 • }
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: C}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 667}
{meta: category Sentences and Responses - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
Lord, bless Thy word to every heart
In this Thy house today,
And help us each as now we part,
Its precepts to obey.
Amen
Amen
{end_of_verse}
